                        <text2
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1659545835858]"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-01-13T10:51:35.724-05:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>We take an evidence-based approach to investigating the signs of aging and their underlying causes, building a portfolio of complementary, next-generation aesthetic solutions that aim to redefine the standard of care. Our pipeline is focused in&amp;nbsp;three areas: neurotoxins, soft tissue fillers, and non-invasive body contouring. Our research interests include:&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b>Advancing the neurotoxin landscape&lt;/b>,&amp;nbsp;building on a decades-long legacy in both aesthetic and therapeutic uses, through prioritising novel indications and a diversified approach of unique formulations, serotypes and durations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b>Evolving the science around dermal fillers&lt;/b>,&amp;nbsp;developing novel injectables and seeking to address signs of aging caused by the loss of structural building blocks of skin and underlying skin tissues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b>Exploring meaningful advances in non-invasive body contouring&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;for localised fat reduction, body sculpting, core strengthening and cellulite treatments, with potential growth areas in skin laxity and scar management.&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
                    </container4_copy>
